            "detailed_description": "Tier 1 is a new take on a 2D space combat simulator. Dogfight in a fast and nimble space fighter, or control interplanetary space using a large lumbering space ship. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose a ship/fighter from nearly two dozen classes. (More will be added over time)<br></li><li>Run games with up to 200 AI bots. (If your computer can handle it)<br></li><li>Massive Scale - Control anything from tiny space fighters to super-carriers that can carry other space ships!<br></li><li>Use the in-depth Radar systems to find your enemy, or use jamming or stealth systems to evade detection.<br></li><li>FTL systems are available to travel long distances quickly, but don't crash into anything along the way.</li></ul><br><br>Game Modes<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rout: Destroy the enemy ships while protecting your own.<br></li><li>Map Control: Control all of the capture points to win.</li></ul>",
